- british
---

Preheat oven to 180°C.

Wash and dry the @floury potatoes{}(e.g. Maris Piper, King Edward, or Marfona). Cut a large cross in the top of the potato. Rub with @olive oil{} and sprinkle with @sea salt{}.

Place directly on oven shelf and bake for 1.25 to ~{1.5%hours}.

Near the end of the cooking time cut the cross open and push down the corners to separate. Optionally increase the oven temperature.